		)
		(property "Description" "ESP32-PICO-V3 SiP: ESP32 (chip rev v3) + 4 MB in-package SPI flash + 40 MHz crystal + RF match and bypass capacitors, Wi-Fi + Bluetooth, LGA-48 7 x 7 mm, 0.5 mm pitch, EP 49 = GND; -40..85 C ambient (in-package flash). In-package flash (datasheet v1.3 Table 5, Fig 8): CMD/IO11 (30) and CLK/IO6 (31) are wired to it, leave them unconnected (no-connect flag, Fig 11 note); GPIO16/17/18/23 drive it inside the SiP and are not exposed. NC pins 25, 35, 36, 44, 45, 47, 48 (Table 4). VDD_SDIO (26) powers the flash internally: leave unconnected (Fig 11). MTDI/IO12 must read 0 at reset (3.3 V flash, Fig 11 note). I34-I39 input only. Alternate ESP32-PICO-V3-02 (same pinout; pins 28/29 then drive in-package PSRAM)"
			(at 0 -38.1 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
